{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_17\">Problem 17</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 17\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive number and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is a function such that, for every positive number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/b/16b093f6996ab4f6c165f7f69a7bf2cc2554237b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[f(x^2+1)\\right]^{\\sqrt{x}}=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"142\" height=\"27\" />; \nthen, for every positive number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fff8c3d2cf5f6fb304c64e9f023193fbfb480fca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[f(\\frac{9+y^2}{y^2})\\right]^{\\sqrt{\\frac{12}{y}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"129\" height=\"54\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/918613459131f7fe5efcfc75a2cfcfdcfcc44029.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\sqrt{k}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }2k\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }k\\sqrt{k}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }k^2\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }y\\sqrt{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"440\" height=\"21\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/4/e94b869a0432519319f754ebb1aa2a49729f295f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[f(x^2 + 1)]^{\\sqrt(x)} = k\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"25\" />\nWe can rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/b/e1bcefb21c7b3c6d196a350706acf9d4c7121da0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9+y^2}{y^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"50\" height=\"42\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/c/c5c0ec24707be198cd4a7aea48c38901d61a0429.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{y^2} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"51\" height=\"41\" />\nThus, our function is now\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24a6b6521e197bec65a6e9ed056bfa3649fd0e86.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[f(\\frac{9}{y^2} + 1)]^{\\sqrt{\\frac{12}{y}}} = k\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70b8fd9d7af0af5e85b2e7b9f0524a21554d089b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rrightarrow[f(\\frac{9}{y^2} + 1)]^{\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{y} \\cdot 4}} = k\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/7/2d71e5b8e88878b025e457cc7b90cf94a36ee380.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rrightarrow([f(\\frac{9}{y^2} + 1)]^{\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{y}}})^{\\sqrt{4}} = (k)^{\\sqrt{4}}\\]\" width=\"235\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e460018013bb355ec9ae042c0c9e10e496d44d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rrightarrow([f(\\frac{9}{y^2} + 1)]^{\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{y}}})^{2} = (k)^{2} = k^2\\]\" width=\"254\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/5/ea55a27eff92d6c346a1d6d2a117f9fc0f8e31c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2\\implies \\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"96\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~JustinLee2017\n</p><p>~clarification by Leon\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=